      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Maritime Fleet Tracking &amp; OT Security</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-ink/70">A regional shipping operator needed real-time fleet tracking and vessel OT security across 45 vessels operating in satellite-dependent environments. MEAICON delivered edge-compute nodes on every vessel, post-quantum-ready telemetry links, and a shore-side fleet operations centre with 99.99 percent uptime.</p>
